      "text": "A True Hero\n\nIn a massive fire in Mandaue City, Philippines, a woman refused to flee without her two fluffy Pomeranians.\n\nShe tossed each dog over the third-floor railing to safety below (where firefighters and bystanders caught them), then climbed over the railing herself. The ladder didn't quite reach, so she hung from it until firefighters rescued her.\n\nShe survived with minor injuries. Her dogs were unharmed because love conquered fear.\n\nThis heartwarming incident occurred on December 10, 2025, in a three-story building in Barangay Guizo. The woman, Ei Mei Lee Maningo, has been hailed as a hero online for prioritizing her pets.\n\nWhat an incredible display of bravery and loyalty! 🐶❤️",
